        "description": "Inspect actual recent assistant messages, not instructions. yes means the assistant already delivered the Freya Bank digital-assistant/recording opening and asked Am I speaking with the named customer. no means the caller spoke first and neither was delivered. unknown means history is insufficient. none is the consumed sentinel. Do not infer delivery merely because this is the opening node.",
        "min_confidence": 0.65
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/workflow/nodes/technical_hold",
      "value": {
        "name": "technical_hold",
        "node_type": "conversation",
        "on_enter": {
          "type": "tts",
          "text": "I could not complete that action."
        },
        "task_message": "A required operation or policy calculation was unavailable. Wait for the caller's reply; no conversation tool is allowed. The engine evaluates that reply. Do not repeat a goodbye, claim completion, disclose unverified account information or invent a security question. The permitted recovery actions are resuming the original authorized question, answering an AI or scam question, handling a request for a person with the one help-first question, or applying the source's identity-refusal and twice-do-not-talk rules. A failed final bank closure does not authorize a duplicate close or a false successful hangup.",
        "extraction_schema": [
          {
            "name": "recovery_event",
            "type": "string",
            "enum_values": [
              "none",
              "human",
              "no_talk",
              "about",
              "ai",
              "scam",
              "resume",
              "unknown"
            ],
            "description": "Newest reply only. human requests a person; no_talk explicitly ends or declines the conversation, including an actual goodbye; about asks the purpose; ai asks whether this is an AI; scam questions authenticity; resume asks to continue or retry; unknown is unclear speech, confusion or another question. none means no fresh reply. Do not classify mere confusion as refusal.",
            "min_confidence": 0.65
